key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.938" end="53.430">可是</span><span begin="53.430" end="53.943">为</span><span begin="53.943" end="54.921">什么</span> <span begin="55.118" end="55.352">却</span><span begin="55.352" end="56.128">苦笑</span><span begin="56.128" end="57.046">说我</span><span begin="57.046" end="57.485">都</span><span begin="57.485" end="57.924">懂</span><span begin="57.924" end="58.807">了</span></p><p begin="59.176" end="1:05.711" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.176" end="59.624">自尊</span><span begin="59.624" end="1:00.357">常常</span><span begin="1:00.357" end="1:01.309">将人</span><span begin="1:01.309" end="1:02.278">拖着</span> <span begin="1:02.803" end="1:03.551">把爱</span><span begin="1:03.551" end="1:03.947">都</span><span begin="1:03.947" end="1:04.601">走曲</span><span begin="1:04.601" end="1:05.711">折</span></p><p begin="1:06.086" end="1:11.474" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.086" end="1:06.534">假装</span><span begin="1:06.534" end="1:07.279">了解</span> <span begin="1:07.279" end="1:08.028">是怕</span><span begin="1:08.325" end="1:08.996">真相</span><span begin="1:08.996" end="1:09.576">太</span><span begin="1:09.576" end="1:10.435">赤裸</span><span begin="1:10.435" end="1:11.474">裸</span></p><p begin="1:11.533" end="1:13.881" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.533" end="1:12.007">狼狈</span><span begin="1:12.007" end="1:12.755">比失去</span><span begin="1:12.755" end="1:13.294">难</span><span begin="1:13.294" end="1:13.881">受</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.180" end="1:46.327" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:14.180" end="1:17.295" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.180" end="1:14.427">我</span><span begin="1:14.427" end="1:14.884">怀念</span><span begin="1:14.884" end="1:15.236">的</span> <span begin="1:15.237" end="1:15.564">是</span><span begin="1:15.564" end="1:16.261">无话</span><span begin="1:16.261" end="1:17.295">不说</span></p><p begin="1:17.633" end="1:20.950" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin